# Maintainer: FPLinux contributors <fplinux@example.invalid>
pkgname=fplinux-wifi
pkgver=1.0.0
pkgrel=0
pkgdesc="Wi-Fi station and access point tools for FPLinux"
url="https://github.com/fplinux/fplinux"
arch="armv7"
license="GPL-2.0-only"
depends="dbus dbus-openrc fplinux-hostapd fplinux-wpa-supplicant iw openresolv wireless-regdb"
options="!check"
source="fplinux-wifi.initd"
builddir="$srcdir"

package() {
	install -Dm755 "$srcdir/fplinux-wifi.initd" "$pkgdir/etc/init.d/fplinux-wifi"
	mkdir -p "$pkgdir/etc/runlevels/default"
	ln -s /etc/init.d/fplinux-wifi "$pkgdir/etc/runlevels/default/fplinux-wifi"
}
sha512sums="
2b9f2d985571da819beea272d1183e7f35a951c2aa166aa7f15a6a33222e3d821449a85870fbd99c81bcd1f89caae21ee013e27fd39363ff6dd566e664c0bfd1  fplinux-wifi.initd
"
